<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_898_2605.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser freündtlich guotwillig diennst zuovor.
<lb n="2"/>Fürsichtig, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eersam</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weys</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">besunder</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lieb</unclear> unnd guot
