<lb n="19"/>guoten freündt, gedachter Irer vordernn,
<lb n="20"/>letster will, und stifftung, Inn gemelten pfarr=
<lb n="21"/>kürchen, nit mer, wie <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">stifft</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">brieffle</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vermag</unclear>,
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bey</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eüch</unclear> beganngen würdet. So ist <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ann</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eüch</unclear>,
<lb n="23"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnser</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freündtlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bit</unclear>, Ir wellt mit den pflegern,
<lb n="24"/>verschaffenn, daß Ihenig diß stifft brieffle
<lb n="25"/>vermag, widerumb <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Irenn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">handen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">herauß</unclear>
<lb n="26"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geben</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dammit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">stifftenn</unclear> In letster will
<lb n="27"/>nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geendert</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werde</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">annderwerk</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anzulegenn</unclear>
<lb n="28"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wißenn</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> wellenn wir umb <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eüch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freünd=</unclear>
<lb n="29"/>lich verdiennen, datum denn <origDate resp="#ner">27 <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">tag</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fe=</unclear>
<lb n="30"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bruarij</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anno</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">&amp;c</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lviij</unclear></origDate>
<lb n="31"/><orgName role="issuer" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Burgermaister</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> Rath
<lb n="32"/>der stat Villingen</orgName>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_898_2606.jpg" n="2"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_898_2607.jpg" n="3"/>
<lb n="33"/>Ich <persName role="issuer" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ruodolff</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wuert</unclear></persName> burger <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner">sannt Gallen</placeName>,
<lb n="34"/>unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">die</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeitt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kirchennpflager</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <orgName resp="#ner">Sannt Lorentz</orgName>
<lb n="35"/>pfarkilchen, daselbs. Bekenn offennlich mit
<lb n="36"/>disem brieff, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuer</unclear> mich unnd mein nachkomen,
<lb n="37"/>und thuon kundt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allermeniglich</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Daß</unclear> ich von,
<lb n="38"/>der ersamen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frauw</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Frenen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Hixin</unclear></persName>, herren
<lb n="39"/><persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Anthony</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Geißennbergers</unclear></persName> vom <placeName resp="#ner">Gschwend</placeName>,
<lb n="40"/>elichenn haußfrawen, enpfangen hab
<lb n="41"/>zechenn schilling <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pfening</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jeerlichß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zinß</unclear>
<lb n="42"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">so</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sy</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gehabt</unclear> hat unnd ir jeerlich gangen
<lb n="43"/>sindt, ab vonn und usser, <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ruschenn</unclear> Teschmach</persName>=
<lb n="44"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hauß</unclear>, unnd hoffstat <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner">sannt Gallenn</placeName> inn
<lb n="45"/>der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vorstat</unclear>, hinder <orgName resp="#ner">sannt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Katherinenn</unclear>
<lb n="46"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">closter</unclear></orgName>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">glagenn</unclear>, nach <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">innhallt</unclear> ains <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zinß=</unclear>
<lb n="47"/>brieffs, dariiber versygellt gebenn den sy
<lb n="48"/>mir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">iiberantwurt</unclear> hat, mit solher beschaiden=
<lb n="49"/>hait, daß neiin priester, uff der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">obgenannten</unclear>
<lb n="50"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kirchenn</unclear> <orgName resp="#ner">Sannt Lorentzen</orgName>, darumb hinfuer
<lb n="51"/>ain ewig jhartziit habenn, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sollenn</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuer</unclear> ir
<lb n="52"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vater</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> muoter unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">all</unclear> ir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vordernn</unclear>,
<lb n="53"/>unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuer</unclear> sy unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">all</unclear> ir nachkomen, seelenn
<lb n="54"/>haill unnd trost willen, und daß jeerlich,
<lb n="55"/>begonn, uff <date resp="#ner">sannt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gregorienn</unclear> tag</date>, inn der,
<lb n="56"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vastenn</unclear>, vor oder nach, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ungevarlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allweg</unclear>
<lb n="57"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">am</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">abenndt</unclear>, mit der sel vegill und ammor=
<lb n="58"/>endtz deß mit der selmeß, wie dann solhs,
<lb n="59"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">aigenntlich</unclear>, inn <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">das</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jartziitbuoch</unclear>, zuo Sannt
<lb n="60"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Lorenntzen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gesetzt</unclear> und geschribenn ist, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daß</unclear>
<lb n="61"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ann</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allenn</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">abganng</unclear>, zuo ewigenn <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeiten</unclear>
<lb n="62"/>zuo <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">begonn</unclear>, und nicht underlassenn. Unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deß</unclear>
<lb n="63"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alles</unclear>, zuo <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">warem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">urkhundt</unclear>, so hab ich obge=
<lb n="64"/>mellter amman, <persName role="issuer" resp="#ner">Ruodolff Wuert</persName>, mein aigen,
<lb n="65"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">insigell</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuer</unclear> mich, unnd mein nachkomen,
<lb n="66"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kirchennpflager</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allso</unclear> von der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kirchenn</unclear> wegen,
<lb n="67"/>offennlich gehennckt, ann dysenn brieff
<lb n="68"/>der gebenn ist <origDate resp="#ner">uff <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">denn</unclear> nechsten monntag
<lb n="69"/>vor <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">creiitzmittwoch</unclear>, nach Cristus gebuurt
